": "38347751224815589", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620965_38347751238148921_5057248519300288108_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WBktqrRGUmUQ7kNvwHt2AO9&_nc_oc=AdqbnBdqblea-ltJ7G0EctpJ0XeGysTZ_FMqtBOlRMf_rAUz4A8DY8Xc4xjD-WgGFps&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKsFlvNGSxLPs77CuyTl0whCHjFUDZSWOKvgqStJCbCMQ&oe=6A983697"}, {"file_name": "cap_shot2-lane_1.png", "id": "1344809297858874", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604282317_1344809301192207_4447666598631232526_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4TqVNXrAWfwQ7kNvwGA3B8r&_nc_oc=AdqRg0Nhxc71ZzBNybciLBeXLThOHeWQptiMA_KBsBAeZ-zqLzaUw3tQWoi6thj391w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQI-QUO6qTbyRYVRq_UxwpL5bLhUzQtMg9N1KnnU_VkuEA&oe=6A98408B"}, {"file_name": "cap_shot3-depth-alt_1.png", "id": "1040915801870464", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623400_1040915808537130_4781429846582066514_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mL4ES8GYj0sQ7kNvwE72GJd&_nc_oc=AdotqivSJD_8OF7iRHCo-4lGDSNDQG9z-Lh5fgLPxFSrc-fd78-G27aEVMxmleK1L5c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIYZkTVPgMR2bvEogECu91peTnviEEZzQSWcH3WzvZ9Fw&oe=6A98418E"}, {"file_name": "cap_shot4-score_1.png", "id": "27554383440855653", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499624983_27554383447522319_1875656870862086556_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1af2g_FF6OAQ7kNvwGwWc6G&_nc_oc=AdoHk_e3sYghyALt-ocw8A0bHOxI45ViKV7F38TpT1Tt1S_K-ozYEOyQDtMNlm1XLPQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIhgNB_L__QkN1WGl0A5PTCGmvxAneZB-32wkt6YrW4kQ&oe=6A9862F6"}, {"file_name": "cap_shot5-rest_1.png", "id": "1706333930584924", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622211_1706333933918257_8714833817623575886_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YBSEK7dMT4gQ7kNvwG9YrjJ&_nc_oc=Adr8MouZA87kJAiPU6qQrt2DBiaHlKxB4wzOhWUVZQ6U9UAgycemGTzKE2w0pcEDAZ8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLvq6En51-C25kJQuCaXUatdsZDz6dadQeFnBu0jyYuCw&oe=6A983694"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "AxeArcade_trailer_cover.png", "id": "1061070172992027", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604282317_1061070176325360_7984314788343204879_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YN_su6TJGvwQ7kNvwHnrpFp&_nc_oc=AdqY5XZ2S8Rc3P2FhPpnTOZKx-y8vFNeDkggyaBvcPbgSeOAYlye_jNM8_VoHaIXKBg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIuZuGqfhWMEXwSUEUyiKBRkAYCOAu_h_dsI4KV7qEluQ&oe=6A984BD3"}, "display_name": "Axe Arcade", "keywords": ["axe", "throwing", "arcade", "bullseye", "casual"], "long_description": "**How good is your throw?**\n\nPick up an axe with a natural grip, feel its weight as you wind up, and send it spinning end-over-end into the board. Every throw is pure physics and timing \u2014 nail the bullseye for the big score and chase a higher total round after round.\n\n## What you do\n- Grab the axe anywhere on the handle \u2014 grip button, either hand.\n- Wind up and release with a real throwing motion; the axe flies the way you throw it.\n- Hit the target board \u2014 the closer to the bullseye, the bigger the score.\n- Ten throws a round. Beat your high score.\n\n## Pick your challenge\n- Four difficulty tiers: EASY, NORMAL, VIKING and BERSERKER.\n- Two venues to throw in \u2014 the Training Field and Fjord Lane.\n- Fjord Lane adds a distance ladder: land a scoring hit and the board steps farther away.\n- Leaderboards for your best rounds.\n\n## Built for comfort\n- Play seated or standing \u2014 everything is within arm's reach.\n- No artificial movement, no smooth turning, no vection. Comfortable rating.\n- Simple to learn, satisfying to master.", "short_description": "Grab an axe, wind up, and let it fly \u2014 sink bullseyes and climb the high-sco